# std::time::SystemTime occurrences allowed to stay in the web dependency
# graph. Checked by web/check-wasm-systemtime.sh. Every entry carries a reason,
# because only SystemTime::now() panics on wasm32-unknown-unknown -- UNIX_EPOCH
# is a const and duration_since / checked_add / cmp are implemented, so a
# type-only use is harmless while a clock read aborts the whole app.
#
# Lines beginning with # and blank lines are ignored. Entries must stay in the
# order `sort` produces for the `path:match` text, which is what the gate
# compares against.

