# Blocked by a consumer type, not skipped. This is a real clock read that would
# abort the browser if reached. The value lands in
# `OAuthTokens { expires_at: Option<SystemTime> }`, which derives Serialize and
# Deserialize, and web_time::SystemTime has no serde impls unless web-time's
# `serde` feature is enabled -- which would change the root workspace manifest.
# The flow that produces the tokens also cannot start in a browser:
# oauth_callback_server::start_oauth_callback_server()'s wasm arm returns Err
# because it cannot bind a loopback TCP port.
