# std::time::SystemTime, so importing web_time::SystemTime here stops the cache
# compiling for wasm (E0308: the two types are distinct). now_millis() reads the
# clock through a fully qualified web_time:: path instead. A native build cannot
# catch this, because web_time re-exports std verbatim off wasm -- only the
# wasm32-unknown-unknown build separates the two types.
